   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Hell In A Bucket** (1 review): Listener enjoys this early version of the song, finding it bluesy [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Hell In A Bucket, Hell In A Bucket, Hell In A Bucket, Hell In A Bucket, Hell In A Bucket [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd83-01-24.sbd.miller.21264.sbeok.shnf** (recommended): soundboard; 18 songs; 48 min; rated 2.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Describes the soundboard as hollow-sounding but still pleasant; The EQ is flat, which detracts from the recording's quality [2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer sees the rehearsal as a revealing look at the band's working process [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd83-01-24.sbd.miller.21264.sbeok.shnf**: source: Studio Rehearsals Recording Info:SBD -> Reel Master -> Cass -> CD -> EAC -> SHN Converted By Charlie an archive.org user12/5/03 [1]",
